{"product_id":"around-greece-in-80-stays","title":"Around Greece in 80 Stays","description":"\u003cp\u003eThis guide covers 80 exceptional small inns and guesthouses throughout Greece. These are not the tourist hotels on the beaches, rather these are exceptional small places with owners that care about their service and offer the best there is of Greece. The photographs throughout the book make clear the style and uniqueness of each place. Not for the traveler that wants popular resorts, noisy bars and crowded beaches, this guide is ideal for those with a little more time and money and an interest in seeing Greece behind the travel posters.\u003cbr\u003e\nDimensions:  \u003cbr\u003e\n Author: Jacoline Vinke \u003cbr\u003e\n ISBN: 9789608189720 \u003cbr\u003e\n Format: Map \u003cbr\u003e\n Pages 376\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookloopbook.com","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":44994235596953,"sku":"14RA9789608189720","price":50.0,"currency_code":"$","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/6fd0d4d00bf80d1eaab61e4db5053e4f.jpg?v=1733332924","url":"https:\/\/bookloopbook.com\/products\/around-greece-in-80-stays","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","version":"1.0","type":"link"}